{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Marisa  $Yukari  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Marisa Kirisame",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the unchanging goddess."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "　　　　　　However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "　　　　　　How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness Gensokyo's changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Marisa's House."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A cozy house of magic in the Forest of Magic."
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >You called?"
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Aah! No, I didn't!"
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >Ah, no, I should've called you already.",
                "<l$> You were looking into the Incident Stone, weren't you?"
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Why do you ask?"
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >Because I was the one who gave it to you."
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >What?!"
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >And you managed to use it to avert the incident, didn't you?"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Alright, gimme the full story."
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >In the Outside World, an artificial intelligence—what they call AI—is trying to drag countless truths down into fiction."
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because of that, a huge flood of information was bound to flow into Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If left unchecked, it would throw Gensokyo into chaos."
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >If information about living beings—in other words, impurity—reaches the Lunar Capital,",
                "<l$> it wouldn’t be able to maintain eternity, and therefore collapse."
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However, the Lunar Capital's situation is even more dire."
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After all, it stands only on a foundation of beautiful, carefully selected information.",
                "In other words, it's built on a delicate facade."
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Huh, I see...?"
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Wha-?!"
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >It's almost considerate, isn't it? Giving us a proper warning."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Alright, y'lost me."
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So I thought it over, using what little brain I have."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Thus, I came up with an idea: to fight incident with incident,",
                "and cautiously embrace change."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >The Lunarians caused this incident to neutralize the influx of information from the outside."
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In fact, before this incident began, they came to me for advice."
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They said that with or without their plan, Gensokyo would likely die anyway."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >Basically, we're giving you humans the power of incidents itself,",
                "<l$> to outwit the Lunarians’ schemes. That is all."
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >So, did ya come up with that weird plan all by yourself?"
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >No. It was a last gambit devised by all those who truly love Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All I did was quietly hand the stone to you."
            ]
        },
        "41_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Marisa was dumbfounded."
            ]
        },
        "44_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Still, who exactly were these \"people who love Gensokyo\"?"
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >The Incident Stones were real, after all."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "　　　　　　Now I can take some time off of work, thanks to you. Thank you."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Hey, wait, bring Gensokyo back to its original state first!"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >It's all right. If I release my power, Gensokyo will return to its usual state."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >What? \"Depends on me\"? What do you mean...?"
            ]
        },
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Not to mention, instilling the stone with the incidents is certainly not something I'm capable of."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Giving up change and losing their powers was all a plan the youkai of Gensokyo devised to save themselves."
            ]
        },
        "43_0": {
            "lines": [
                "While it was hard to swallow in the moment, the youkai in front of her knowing everything had convinced her otherwise."
            ]
        },
        "45_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Perhaps it was the one who once resided on the moon, or perhaps the usual mastermind..."
            ]
        },
        "46_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Could there be others?"
            ]
        },
        "47_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Perhaps even Ariya was in on it."
            ]
        },
        "48_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Furthermore, who created the Incident Stone?",
                "There weren't enough answers to her questions."
            ]
        },
        "49_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$ Ending No.11 A Desperate Plan$>"
            ]
        }
    }
}